<title>PHILIPPINES: Jollibee declares 0.08-peso cash div.</title>
<headline>Jollibee declares 0.08-peso cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jollibee Foods Corp on Wednesday declared a 0.08 peso cash dividend to shareholders of record as of November 14, 1996.</p>
<p>The fast food company said in a statement that the dividend will be payable on December 6.</p>
<p>This is the second 0.08 peso cash dividend the company has declared for the year. Last year, the company granted total cash dividends of 0.14 peso.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
